elopment"}]],[["$","li","Agencies",{"children":"Agencies"}]]]}]]}],["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-12.16.09-1400x763.png 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-12.16.09-2000x1090.png 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-12.16.09-500x273.png 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-12.16.09-768x419.png 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-12.16.09-1536x837.png 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-12.16.09-2048x1116.png 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-12.16.09-2560x1395.png","mediaDetails":{"width":3000,"height":1635}},"layout":"fill"}],["$","video",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/Right-Formula-Scroll.mp4","className":"ProjectCard_video__AheFz","autoPlay":true,"muted":true,"loop":true,"preload":"none","playsInline":true}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedProjects_viewAllLinkMobile__pDKQH","children":["$","$L11",null,{"type":"a-internal","text":"View all projects","color":"white","href":"/work"}]}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FaqsList_faqsList__W3Ud0","children":[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_heading__kNT8k","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":"FAQ's"}]}]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"What role does customer research play in developing a brand strategy?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Customer research is your starting point. It offers insights into your audience&#8217;s needs, preferences, and behaviours, enabling you to tailor your brand to genuinely resonate with them. Understanding your audience ensures your brand strategy is not just a shot in the dark but a targeted effort to connect and engage effectively.</p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"How can a strong brand strategy impact my business's bottom line?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Simply put, by building a strong, recognisable brand that attracts and retains loyal customers. It differentiates your offerings in a crowded market, allowing you to command premium pricing and foster customer loyalty, ultimately driving up revenue and profitability.</p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"What's the difference between a brand strategy and a marketing strategy?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>This one’s a question that comes up a lot! You’d be forgiven for thinking they’re the same, but a brand strategy defines who you are and what you stand for; it&#8217;s the blueprint of your identity and values. A marketing strategy, on the other hand, outlines how you communicate your brand to the world, focusing on tactics and channels to engage your audience. Both strategies work hand-in-hand to achieve business success, with branding as the core and marketing as the amplifier.</p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"How can I align my brand strategy with my business goals?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Always make sure everything you do leads back to those bigger business goals. This involves ensuring that your brand’s identity, values, and messaging support and enhance your overarching objectives. It’ll make sure that every aspect of your brand—from your visual identity to your customer experience— propels you towards achieving your business aims, whether that’s market leadership, innovation, customer loyalty, or expansion.</p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Can my brand strategy evolve over time, and how?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Of course! Your brand strategy can and should evolve over time to stay relevant and responsive to market changes, customer needs, and your own business growth. This evolution involves regular review and adaptation of your brand&#8217;s core elements, ensuring they continue to reflect your business&#8217;s current position and future aspirations while staying true to your foundational identity.</p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"What common mistakes should I avoid in brand strategy development?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Always make sure you’re not overlooking the importance of consistency and clarity across all your brand elements, underestimating the value of customer insights, or being inflexible to market changes. Neglecting these big 3 can lead to a really disjointed brand experience, diminished relevance, and missed opportunities for engagement and growth. And no one wants that. Prioritise a cohesive, customer-focused, and adaptable approach to ensure your brand strategy&#8217;s success.</p>\n"}}]}]]}]}]]]}]]}],"$L2d","$L2e"]}]]
